<title>USA: U.S. interest rates little changed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates little changed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended Jan 31, compared with the Jan 24 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.18 vs 5.19</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............5.04 vs 5.04</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.45 vs 5.44</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.33 vs 5.33</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.42 vs 5.42</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.44 vs 5.44</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............6.89 vs 6.84</p>
</text>
